POSTS = [
dict(slug='ai-assisted-ui-design-workflow', date='2026-10-14', tags=['workflow','AI'],
 t=dict(en='AI-assisted UI design: a workflow that keeps taste in the loop', zh='AI 辅助 UI 设计：一条不丢审美的工作流', zht='AI 輔助 UI 設計：一條不丟審美的工作流', ja='AI支援UIデザイン：センスを手放さないワークフロー', ko='AI 보조 UI 디자인: 취향을 잃지 않는 워크플로', ms='Reka bentuk UI berbantu AI: aliran kerja yang mengekalkan cita rasa', vi='Thiết kế UI có AI hỗ trợ: quy trình giữ được gu thẩm mỹ', fr="Design d'UI assisté par l'IA : un flux qui garde le goût dans la boucle", es='Diseño de UI asistido por IA: un flujo que mantiene el criterio', de='KI-gestütztes UI-Design: ein Workflow, der Geschmack im Spiel hält'),
 s=dict(en='Generators are fast but average. Split the job: humans set direction and constraints, AI explores variants, humans curate and polish.', zh='生成器快但平庸。把活拆开：人定方向和约束，AI 铺变体，人来挑选和打磨。', zht='生成器快但平庸。把活拆開：人定方向和約束，AI 鋪變體，人來挑選和打磨。', ja='生成ツールは速いが平均的。方向と制約は人、バリエーションはAI、選別と仕上げは人。', ko='생성기는 빠르지만 평범하다. 방향과 제약은 사람, 변형은 AI, 선별과 다듬기는 사람.', ms='Penjana pantas tetapi biasa. Manusia tetapkan hala, AI teroka variasi, manusia pilih dan gilap.', vi='Công cụ sinh nhanh nhưng tầm thường. Người định hướng, AI khám phá biến thể, người chọn lọc và hoàn thiện.', fr="Rapides mais moyens : l'humain fixe la direction, l'IA explore, l'humain sélectionne et peaufine.", es='Rápidos pero promedio: el humano fija la dirección, la IA explora, el humano elige y pule.', de='Schnell, aber durchschnittlich: Mensch gibt Richtung vor, KI exploriert, Mensch kuratiert und poliert.'),
 en="""<p>Every AI UI generator converges on the statistical middle of its training data: centred hero, three feature cards, a purple gradient. That is not a bug, it is what "most likely next token" means. The practical consequence is that speed is free and <strong>taste is the scarce input</strong>.</p>
<h2>Split the job into four passes</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Direction (human).</strong> Write a one-paragraph brief: audience, one adjective you want and one you refuse, a reference product, density level. NN/g's testing of AI design tools found outputs were generic unless the prompt carried real context.</li>
<li><strong>Exploration (AI).</strong> Ask v0 or Claude for 4–6 deliberately different directions, not one "best" page. Diversity is where generators shine.</li>
<li><strong>Curation (human).</strong> Pick one, then name what is wrong in concrete terms: "line length over 80ch", "two accent colours competing".</li>
<li><strong>Polish (AI + human).</strong> Feed those notes back, or run a critique skill such as <em>impeccable</em> or <em>baseline-ui</em>, then do the last 10% by hand.</li></ol>
<h2>Our take</h2>
<p>The biggest win is not generation but <strong>constraint files</strong>: a short DESIGN.md with tokens, spacing scale and banned patterns that every agent reads first. It turns one good decision into a hundred consistent screens. On UI Hub, filter by <em>Skill</em> to find ready-made ones.</p>
<h2>Checklist</h2><ul><li>Brief has a "never" list</li><li>Ask for variants, not a page</li><li>Critique with named problems</li><li>Lock decisions into tokens</li></ul>""",
 zh="""<p>所有 AI 界面生成器都会收敛到训练数据的"平均值"：居中大标题、三张特性卡、一道紫色渐变。这不是 bug，而是"最可能的下一个词"的本义。结论很直接：<strong>速度已经免费，稀缺的是审美输入</strong>。</p>
<h2>把活拆成四遍</h2>
<ol><li><strong>定方向（人）</strong>：写一段话的简报——给谁用、想要的一个形容词和拒绝的一个形容词、一个参考产品、信息密度。NN/g 对 AI 设计工具的测试显示，提示里没有真实上下文时，产出几乎都是通用模板。</li>
<li><strong>铺变体（AI）</strong>：让 v0 或 Claude 一次给 4–6 个刻意不同的方向，而不是一个"最好"的页面。多样性才是生成器的长处。</li>
<li><strong>挑选（人）</strong>：选定一个，再用具体语言指出问题，比如"行宽超过 80 字符""两个强调色在打架"。</li>
<li><strong>打磨（AI + 人）</strong>：把意见喂回去，或者跑 <em>impeccable</em>、<em>baseline-ui</em> 这类走查 skill，最后 10% 手工收尾。</li></ol>
<h2>我们的看法</h2>
<p>最大的收益不在生成，而在<strong>约束文件</strong>：一份简短的 DESIGN.md，写清 token、间距刻度和禁用样式，让每个 Agent 先读它。一次好决定就能变成一百个一致的页面。在 UI Hub 里筛选「Skill」就能找到现成的。</p>
<h2>清单</h2><ul><li>简报里有"禁止"清单</li><li>要变体，不要单页</li><li>点名具体问题</li><li>把决定固化成 token</li></ul>""",
 refs=[('Status Update: AI UX-Design Tools Are Not Ready for Primetime','Nielsen Norman Group','https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-design-tools-not-ready/'),('v0 Documentation','Vercel','https://v0.app/docs'),('Agent Skills repository','Anthropic','https://github.com/anthropics/skills'),('impeccable','Paul Bakaus','https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable')]),

dict(slug='prompts-for-ui', date='2026-10-14', tags=['prompt'],
 t=dict(en='Prompting for UI: write specs, not wishes', zh='写 UI 提示词：写规格，不要写愿望', zht='寫 UI 提示詞：寫規格，不要寫願望', ja='UIのためのプロンプト：願望ではなく仕様を書く', ko='UI 프롬프트: 소원 말고 명세를 써라', ms='Prompt untuk UI: tulis spesifikasi, bukan hasrat', vi='Viết prompt cho UI: viết đặc tả, đừng viết mong muốn', fr="Prompts pour l'UI : écrire des specs, pas des souhaits", es='Prompts para UI: escribe especificaciones, no deseos', de='Prompts für UI: Spezifikationen statt Wünsche'),
 s=dict(en='"Modern and clean" means nothing to a model. Name layout, tokens, states, content and what to avoid.', zh='"现代、简洁"对模型毫无信息量。要写清布局、token、状态、真实内容和禁区。', zht='「現代、簡潔」對模型毫無資訊量。要寫清佈局、token、狀態、真實內容和禁區。', ja='「モダンでクリーン」はモデルに何も伝えない。レイアウト、トークン、状態、内容、禁止事項を書く。', ko='"모던하고 깔끔하게"는 의미가 없다. 레이아웃, 토큰, 상태, 콘텐츠, 금지 사항을 적어라.', ms='"Moden dan bersih" tiada makna. Nyatakan susun atur, token, keadaan, kandungan dan larangan.', vi='"Hiện đại, gọn gàng" chẳng nói gì. Hãy nêu bố cục, token, trạng thái, nội dung và điều cấm.', fr='« Moderne et épuré » ne dit rien. Précisez mise en page, tokens, états, contenu et interdits.', es='"Moderno y limpio" no dice nada. Indica layout, tokens, estados, contenido y prohibiciones.', de='„Modern und clean“ sagt nichts. Nenne Layout, Tokens, Zustände, Inhalt und Verbote.'),
 en="""<p>A UI prompt is a tiny design spec. The model fills every gap with defaults, so each gap you leave becomes a cliché.</p>
<h2>The six-slot template</h2>
<pre><code>Goal: pricing page for a dev tool, 3 tiers, annual toggle
Layout: 12-col, max 1200px, tiers in a row ≥ 900px, stacked below
Tokens: Geist, 14/20 body, radius 10, one accent #2563eb, neutral greys
States: hover, focus-visible ring, selected tier, loading on CTA
Content: real copy below (no lorem), prices 0 / 19 / 49
Avoid: gradients on text, glassmorphism, emoji icons, centred everything</code></pre>
<h2>Why it works</h2>
<p>Vercel's design guidelines and Rauno Freiberg's "Interfaces" both stress small, checkable rules: focus states, hit targets, tabular numbers. Turning those into explicit lines makes the output verifiable. Real content matters too; placeholder text hides overflow and hierarchy problems.</p>
<h2>Our take</h2><p>Put the "Avoid" line first when iterating. Models obey negative constraints better once they have seen the bad version. Keep a reusable prompt per component type; UI Hub's component cards include a copyable prompt you can start from.</p>""",
 zh="""<p>UI 提示词就是一份迷你设计规格。模型会用默认值填满你留下的每个空白，而每个空白最后都会变成套路。</p>
<h2>六格模板</h2>
<pre><code>目标：开发者工具定价页，3 档，年付切换
布局：12 栏，最大 1200px，≥900px 三档并排，以下堆叠
Token：Geist 字体，正文 14/20，圆角 10，唯一强调色 #2563eb，中性灰
状态：hover、focus-visible 描边、选中档、按钮加载态
内容：使用下方真实文案（不要 lorem），价格 0 / 19 / 49
禁止：文字渐变、玻璃拟态、emoji 图标、全部居中</code></pre>
<h2>为什么有效</h2>
<p>Vercel 的设计规范和 Rauno Freiberg 的《Interfaces》都强调小而可检查的规则：焦点状态、点击区域、等宽数字。把它们写成明确的行，产出就能被验收。真实内容也很重要，占位文字会掩盖溢出和层级问题。</p>
<h2>我们的看法</h2><p>迭代时把"禁止"一行放到最前面。模型见过坏版本后，对否定约束的服从度更高。每类组件留一份可复用提示词；UI Hub 的组件卡都带可复制的 Prompt，可以直接起步。</p>""",
 refs=[('Web Interface Guidelines','Vercel','https://vercel.com/design/guidelines'),('Web Interface Guidelines (interfaces.rauno.me)','Rauno Freiberg','https://interfaces.rauno.me'),('v0 Documentation','Vercel','https://v0.app/docs'),('Refactoring UI','Adam Wathan & Steve Schoger','https://www.refactoringui.com')]),

dict(slug='design-to-code-with-ai', date='2026-10-14', tags=['design-to-code','Figma'],
 t=dict(en='Design-to-code with AI: map to your components, not to pixels', zh='用 AI 从设计稿到代码：映射到组件，而不是像素', zht='用 AI 從設計稿到程式碼：對應到元件，而不是像素', ja='AIでデザインからコードへ：ピクセルではなくコンポーネントに対応付ける', ko='AI로 디자인→코드: 픽셀이 아니라 컴포넌트에 매핑하라', ms='Reka bentuk ke kod dengan AI: petakan ke komponen, bukan piksel', vi='Từ thiết kế sang code bằng AI: ánh xạ vào component, không phải pixel', fr="Du design au code avec l'IA : mapper vers vos composants, pas des pixels", es='De diseño a código con IA: mapea a tus componentes, no a píxeles', de='Design-to-Code mit KI: auf Komponenten mappen, nicht auf Pixel'),
 s=dict(en='Pixel-perfect export creates throwaway code. Give the agent your component registry and tokens via MCP so output reuses what you already ship.', zh='像素级导出只会产出一次性代码。通过 MCP 把组件注册表和 token 交给 Agent，让产出复用现有组件。', zht='像素級匯出只會產出一次性程式碼。透過 MCP 把元件註冊表和 token 交給 Agent。', ja='ピクセル完全な書き出しは使い捨てコードになる。MCPでレジストリとトークンを渡そう。', ko='픽셀 퍼펙트 내보내기는 일회용 코드다. MCP로 레지스트리와 토큰을 넘겨라.', ms='Eksport piksel sempurna menghasilkan kod pakai buang. Beri registri komponen dan token melalui MCP.', vi='Xuất pixel-perfect tạo code dùng một lần. Đưa registry và token qua MCP.', fr="L'export au pixel produit du code jetable. Donnez registre et tokens via MCP.", es='Exportar al píxel crea código desechable. Pasa registro y tokens vía MCP.', de='Pixelgenauer Export erzeugt Wegwerfcode. Registry und Tokens per MCP übergeben.'),
 en="""<p>Early design-to-code tools translated frames into absolutely positioned divs. They looked right and were unmaintainable. The current generation, Figma's Dev Mode MCP server and Builder.io's Visual Copilot among them, works differently: it reads <em>structure and variables</em> and maps them to code you already own.</p>
<h2>What to feed the agent</h2><ul><li><strong>Tokens</strong> exported as CSS variables, so colours map to <code>var(--accent)</code> instead of hex.</li><li><strong>A component registry</strong>, for example a shadcn registry, so "button" means your Button.</li><li><strong>Auto-layout in the file</strong>. Frames without it force the model to guess flex rules.</li></ul>
<h2>Our take</h2><p>Treat generated code as a pull request from a junior: correct-looking, missing edge states. Always check empty, loading, error and long-text states, and run an a11y pass. Teams that publish a registry once get compounding returns from every later generation.</p>""",
 zh="""<p>早期的设计转代码工具把画板翻译成一堆绝对定位的 div，看着对，却没法维护。新一代工具不一样，比如 Figma 的 Dev Mode MCP Server 和 Builder.io 的 Visual Copilot：它们读取<em>结构和变量</em>，再映射到你已有的代码。</p>
<h2>该喂给 Agent 什么</h2><ul><li><strong>Token</strong>：导出成 CSS 变量，颜色就会映射成 <code>var(--accent)</code> 而不是硬编码色值。</li><li><strong>组件注册表</strong>：比如 shadcn registry，这样"按钮"就是你自己的 Button。</li><li><strong>设计稿里用自动布局</strong>：没有 auto-layout 的画板，模型只能猜 flex 规则。</li></ul>
<h2>我们的看法</h2><p>把生成的代码当成新人提的 PR：看起来没问题，但边界状态缺失。一定要检查空、加载、报错、超长文本这几种状态，再做一遍无障碍检查。先把注册表建好的团队，之后每一次生成都在复利。</p>""",
 refs=[('Introducing the Figma MCP server','Figma','https://www.figma.com/blog/introducing-figma-mcp-server/'),('Figma to code with Visual Copilot','Builder.io','https://www.builder.io/blog/figma-to-code-visual-copilot'),('shadcn/ui Registry','shadcn','https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/registry'),('Tailwind CSS dark mode docs','Tailwind Labs','https://tailwindcss.com/docs/dark-mode')]),

dict(slug='taste-and-skills-for-agents', date='2026-10-14', tags=['skills','taste'],
 t=dict(en='Teaching agents taste: how design skills de-slop AI interfaces', zh='教 Agent 审美：设计 skill 如何去掉 AI 味', zht='教 Agent 審美：設計 skill 如何去掉 AI 味', ja='エージェントにセンスを教える：デザインスキルでAIっぽさを消す', ko='에이전트에게 취향 가르치기: 디자인 스킬로 AI 티 없애기', ms='Mengajar ejen cita rasa: kemahiran reka bentuk membuang rupa "AI"', vi='Dạy agent gu thẩm mỹ: skill thiết kế xoá "mùi AI"', fr="Apprendre le goût aux agents : les skills de design contre l'UI générique", es='Enseñar criterio a los agentes: skills de diseño contra la UI genérica', de='Agenten Geschmack beibringen: Design-Skills gegen generische KI-UIs'),
 s=dict(en='Skills like frontend-design, taste-skill and impeccable package opinions as files agents load on demand. Here is how to combine them.', zh='frontend-design、taste-skill、impeccable 等 skill 把设计观点打包成文件，Agent 按需加载。这里讲怎么组合。', zht='frontend-design、taste-skill、impeccable 等 skill 把設計觀點打包成檔案，Agent 按需載入。', ja='frontend-design、taste-skill、impeccableなどは設計の意見をファイル化したもの。組み合わせ方を解説。', ko='frontend-design, taste-skill, impeccable 같은 스킬은 디자인 관점을 파일로 담는다. 조합법.', ms='Kemahiran seperti frontend-design, taste-skill dan impeccable membungkus pendapat reka bentuk. Cara menggabungkannya.', vi='Các skill như frontend-design, taste-skill, impeccable đóng gói quan điểm thiết kế. Cách kết hợp.', fr='frontend-design, taste-skill, impeccable : des opinions de design en fichiers. Comment les combiner.', es='frontend-design, taste-skill, impeccable: opiniones de diseño en archivos. Cómo combinarlas.', de='frontend-design, taste-skill, impeccable: Design-Meinungen als Dateien. So kombiniert man sie.'),
 en="""<p>An agent skill is a folder with a <code>SKILL.md</code> the agent reads when the task matches its description. For design, that means opinions survive between sessions instead of living in one long prompt.</p>
<h2>A working stack</h2><ol><li><strong>Direction:</strong> <em>frontend-design</em> or <em>taste-skill</em> before writing code. They push a committed aesthetic and ban the usual tells.</li><li><strong>Craft:</strong> <em>emil-design-eng</em> for motion and micro-interaction judgement.</li><li><strong>Audit:</strong> <em>impeccable</em>, <em>baseline-ui</em> and <em>web-design-guidelines</em> after a draft exists.</li><li><strong>Redesign:</strong> <em>redesign-skill</em> when upgrading an existing site.</li></ol>
<h2>Our take</h2><p>Do not load everything at once. Overlapping skills give conflicting advice. Use one direction skill, one craft skill and one audit skill per task. Write project-specific "never" rules in AGENTS.md so they override generic taste.</p>""",
 zh="""<p>Agent skill 就是一个带 <code>SKILL.md</code> 的文件夹，任务和描述匹配时 Agent 会去读它。放在设计上，意味着设计观点可以跨会话保留，而不是塞在一条长提示里。</p>
<h2>一套能用的组合</h2><ol><li><strong>定方向</strong>：写代码前用 <em>frontend-design</em> 或 <em>taste-skill</em>，它们会逼你选定一种明确的审美，并禁掉常见的 AI 痕迹。</li><li><strong>做工艺</strong>：动效和微交互的取舍用 <em>emil-design-eng</em>。</li><li><strong>走查</strong>：有了初稿后跑 <em>impeccable</em>、<em>baseline-ui</em>、<em>web-design-guidelines</em>。</li><li><strong>改版</strong>：升级已有网站时用 <em>redesign-skill</em>。</li></ol>
<h2>我们的看法</h2><p>别一次全加载，重叠的 skill 会互相打架。每个任务一个方向 skill、一个工艺 skill、一个走查 skill 就够了。项目专属的"禁止"规则写进 AGENTS.md，让它压过通用审美。</p>""",
 refs=[('Agent Skills repository','Anthropic','https://github.com/anthropics/skills'),('taste-skill','Leonxlnx','https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill'),('impeccable','Paul Bakaus','https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable'),('AGENTS.md','agents.md','https://agents.md'),('Web Interface Guidelines','Vercel','https://vercel.com/design/guidelines')]),

dict(slug='component-composition', date='2026-10-14', tags=['components','architecture'],
 t=dict(en='Component composition: why headless + copy-paste won', zh='组件组合：为什么"无样式 + 复制粘贴"赢了', zht='元件組合：為什麼「無樣式 + 複製貼上」贏了', ja='コンポーネント合成：ヘッドレス＋コピペが勝った理由', ko='컴포넌트 합성: 헤드리스 + 복붙이 이긴 이유', ms='Komposisi komponen: mengapa headless + salin-tampal menang', vi='Kết hợp component: vì sao headless + copy-paste thắng', fr='Composition de composants : pourquoi headless + copier-coller a gagné', es='Composición de componentes: por qué headless + copiar y pegar ganó', de='Komponenten-Komposition: warum Headless + Copy-Paste gewonnen hat'),
 s=dict(en='Radix behaviour, your styles, code you own. Compound components keep APIs small and make AI edits safer.', zh='Radix 管行为，样式归你，代码在你仓库里。复合组件让 API 更小，AI 改起来也更安全。', zht='Radix 管行為，樣式歸你，程式碼在你倉庫裡。複合元件讓 API 更小，AI 修改更安全。', ja='振る舞いはRadix、スタイルは自分、コードは自分のもの。複合コンポーネントでAPIは小さく、AI編集も安全に。', ko='동작은 Radix, 스타일과 코드는 내 것. 복합 컴포넌트는 API를 작게, AI 수정을 안전하게.', ms='Tingkah laku Radix, gaya anda, kod milik anda. Komponen majmuk menjadikan suntingan AI lebih selamat.', vi='Hành vi của Radix, style của bạn, code của bạn. Component ghép giúp AI sửa an toàn hơn.', fr='Comportement Radix, vos styles, votre code. Les composants composés rendent les éditions IA plus sûres.', es='Comportamiento de Radix, tus estilos, tu código. Los compuestos hacen más seguras las ediciones de IA.', de='Radix-Verhalten, eigene Styles, eigener Code. Compound Components machen KI-Änderungen sicherer.'),
 en="""<p>The old model was a styled npm package you fought with overrides. shadcn/ui flipped it: behaviour and accessibility from Radix primitives, styling in Tailwind, and the source copied into your repo.</p>
<h2>Why it suits AI</h2><ul><li>Code in your repo is <strong>visible context</strong>, so the agent can read and edit it.</li><li><strong>Compound components</strong> (<code>&lt;Dialog.Trigger&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;Dialog.Content&gt;</code>) have small, predictable surfaces, which makes edits less error-prone than a 40-prop monolith.</li><li>Registries let tools install the same component into any project.</li></ul>
<h2>Our take</h2><p>Compose from three layers: primitives (Radix, Ark, React Aria), your styled kit, and page blocks. Let AI work mainly at the block layer and keep primitives untouched. Atomic design's old atoms→organisms idea maps neatly onto this.</p>""",
 zh="""<p>老模式是装一个带样式的 npm 包，然后不停写覆盖样式跟它较劲。shadcn/ui 把它反过来：行为和无障碍交给 Radix 底层组件，样式用 Tailwind，源码直接复制进你的仓库。</p>
<h2>为什么适合 AI</h2><ul><li>代码在你仓库里，就是<strong>可见的上下文</strong>，Agent 能读也能改。</li><li><strong>复合组件</strong>（<code>&lt;Dialog.Trigger&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;Dialog.Content&gt;</code>）接口小且可预测，比 40 个 prop 的巨型组件更不容易改错。</li><li>注册表让工具能把同一个组件装进任何项目。</li></ul>
<h2>我们的看法</h2><p>按三层组合：底层原语（Radix、Ark、React Aria）、自己带样式的组件包、页面区块。让 AI 主要在区块层干活，底层原语别动。原子设计里"原子→有机体"的老思路正好能对上这三层。</p>""",
 refs=[('shadcn/ui docs','shadcn','https://ui.shadcn.com/docs'),('Radix Primitives introduction','WorkOS / Radix','https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/overview/introduction'),('Compound Pattern','patterns.dev (Lydia Hallie & Addy Osmani)','https://www.patterns.dev/react/compound-pattern/'),('Atomic Design, chapter 2','Brad Frost','https://atomicdesign.bradfrost.com/chapter-2/')]),

dict(slug='motion-that-feels-right', date='2026-10-14', tags=['motion'],
 t=dict(en='Motion that feels right: purpose, duration, easing, restraint', zh='让动效"对味"：目的、时长、缓动与克制', zht='讓動效「對味」：目的、時長、緩動與克制', ja='しっくりくるモーション：目的・時間・イージング・抑制', ko='자연스러운 모션: 목적, 시간, 이징, 절제', ms='Gerakan yang terasa betul: tujuan, tempoh, easing, kawalan', vi='Chuyển động đúng cảm giác: mục đích, thời lượng, easing, tiết chế', fr='Un mouvement juste : intention, durée, easing, retenue', es='Movimiento que se siente bien: propósito, duración, easing, contención', de='Bewegung, die sich richtig anfühlt: Zweck, Dauer, Easing, Zurückhaltung'),
 s=dict(en='Most UI motion should be under 300ms, ease-out, and skipped for frequent actions. Spectacle belongs on marketing pages, not in tools.', zh='大多数界面动效应在 300ms 内、用 ease-out，高频操作干脆不做。炫技属于营销页，不属于工具。', zht='大多數介面動效應在 300ms 內、用 ease-out，高頻操作乾脆不做。', ja='UIモーションは300ms以内・ease-out、頻繁な操作には付けない。', ko='UI 모션은 300ms 이하, ease-out, 잦은 동작엔 생략.', ms='Kebanyakan gerakan UI di bawah 300ms, ease-out, dan dilangkau untuk tindakan kerap.', vi='Hầu hết chuyển động dưới 300ms, ease-out, bỏ qua với thao tác thường xuyên.', fr='Moins de 300 ms, ease-out, et rien pour les actions fréquentes.', es='Menos de 300 ms, ease-out, y nada en acciones frecuentes.', de='Unter 300 ms, ease-out, und keine Animation für häufige Aktionen.'),
 en="""<p>Emil Kowalski's rule of thumb is blunt: if a user triggers something a hundred times a day, do not animate it. Motion is for orientation (where did this come from?), feedback (it worked) and, sparingly, delight.</p>
<h2>Numbers to start from</h2><ul><li>Small UI changes: 150–250ms; larger surfaces 300–400ms. Material 3's motion tokens sit in the same ranges.</li><li>Enter with <strong>ease-out</strong>, so the element responds immediately; avoid ease-in for UI.</li><li>Animate <code>transform</code> and <code>opacity</code> only for smooth 60fps.</li><li>Respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>: swap movement for fades.</li></ul>
<h2>Our take</h2><p>Aceternity- and Magic UI-style effects (beams, spotlights, marquees) work as <strong>one hero moment per page</strong>. Stack three and the page looks like a template. Josh Comeau's transition guide is the best explanation of why easing curves matter.</p>""",
 zh="""<p>Emil Kowalski 的经验法则很直接：用户一天要触发一百次的操作，就别加动画。动效的用途是定位（这个东西从哪来）、反馈（操作成功了），偶尔才是取悦。</p>
<h2>起步数值</h2><ul><li>小的界面变化 150–250ms，大面积变化 300–400ms，Material 3 的动效 token 也在这个区间。</li><li>进场用 <strong>ease-out</strong>，元素会立刻有反应；界面里尽量别用 ease-in。</li><li>只对 <code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code> 做动画，才能稳 60fps。</li><li>尊重 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>：把位移换成淡入淡出。</li></ul>
<h2>我们的看法</h2><p>Aceternity、Magic UI 这类特效（光束、聚光灯、跑马灯）每页只放<strong>一个高光时刻</strong>最好，叠三个就像模板站。想弄懂缓动曲线为什么重要，Josh Comeau 的过渡教程讲得最清楚。</p>""",
 refs=[('Great animations','Emil Kowalski','https://emilkowal.ski/ui/great-animations'),('animations.dev','Emil Kowalski','https://animations.dev'),('Motion overview — Material 3','Google','https://m3.material.io/styles/motion/overview'),('An Interactive Guide to CSS Transitions','Josh W. Comeau','https://www.joshwcomeau.com/animation/css-transitions/'),('prefers-reduced-motion','MDN','https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/prefers-reduced-motion'),('Motion docs','Motion','https://motion.dev/docs')]),

dict(slug='dark-mode-done-right', date='2026-10-14', tags=['dark mode','tokens'],
 t=dict(en='Dark mode done right: tokens, elevation and contrast', zh='把暗色模式做对：token、层级与对比度', zht='把暗色模式做對：token、層級與對比度', ja='正しいダークモード：トークン・階層・コントラスト', ko='다크 모드 제대로: 토큰, 고도, 대비', ms='Mod gelap yang betul: token, ketinggian dan kontras', vi='Làm dark mode đúng: token, độ nổi và độ tương phản', fr='Un mode sombre réussi : tokens, élévation et contraste', es='Modo oscuro bien hecho: tokens, elevación y contraste', de='Dark Mode richtig: Tokens, Elevation und Kontrast'),
 s=dict(en='Dark mode is a second palette, not an inverted one. Use semantic tokens, lighter surfaces for elevation, and desaturated accents.', zh='暗色模式是第二套配色，不是反色。用语义 token，用更亮的表面表达层级，强调色要降饱和。', zht='暗色模式是第二套配色，不是反色。用語義 token，用更亮的表面表達層級。', ja='ダークモードは反転ではなく第二のパレット。意味トークン、明るい面で階層、彩度を下げたアクセント。', ko='다크 모드는 반전이 아니라 두 번째 팔레트. 시맨틱 토큰, 밝은 면으로 고도 표현.', ms='Mod gelap ialah palet kedua, bukan terbalik. Guna token semantik dan permukaan lebih cerah untuk ketinggian.', vi='Dark mode là bảng màu thứ hai, không phải đảo màu. Dùng token ngữ nghĩa, bề mặt sáng hơn để thể hiện độ nổi.', fr="Une seconde palette, pas une inversion. Tokens sémantiques, surfaces plus claires pour l'élévation.", es='Una segunda paleta, no una inversión. Tokens semánticos y superficies más claras para la elevación.', de='Eine zweite Palette, keine Invertierung. Semantische Tokens, hellere Flächen für Elevation.'),
 en="""<p>Inverting colours gives you pure black backgrounds, glowing saturated blues and shadows nobody can see. Apple's HIG and web.dev both describe dark mode as its own design pass.</p>
<h2>Rules</h2><ul><li><strong>Semantic tokens:</strong> <code>--bg</code>, <code>--surface</code>, <code>--ink</code>, <code>--accent</code>, swapped per theme with <code>[data-theme]</code> or <code>prefers-color-scheme</code>.</li><li><strong>Elevation by lightness:</strong> raised surfaces get slightly lighter, because shadows barely read on dark.</li><li><strong>Off-black, off-white:</strong> e.g. #06070b and #f3f5fb reduce halation.</li><li><strong>Desaturate accents</strong> and re-check 4.5:1 text contrast in both themes.</li><li>Set <code>color-scheme</code> so form controls and scrollbars follow.</li></ul>
<h2>Our take</h2><p>NN/g's research shows preference is split, so ship both and remember the choice. Screenshots of previews need both themes too; UI Hub stores light and dark shots per component for exactly this reason.</p>""",
 zh="""<p>直接反色，得到的是纯黑背景、刺眼的高饱和蓝和根本看不见的阴影。Apple HIG 和 web.dev 都把暗色模式当成一轮独立的设计工作。</p>
<h2>规则</h2><ul><li><strong>语义 token</strong>：<code>--bg</code>、<code>--surface</code>、<code>--ink</code>、<code>--accent</code>，用 <code>[data-theme]</code> 或 <code>prefers-color-scheme</code> 按主题切换。</li><li><strong>用亮度表达层级</strong>：越高的表面越亮一点，因为阴影在深色上几乎看不出。</li><li><strong>不用纯黑纯白</strong>：比如 #06070b 和 #f3f5fb，能减少光晕感。</li><li><strong>强调色降饱和</strong>，两个主题都要重新核对 4.5:1 的文字对比度。</li><li>设置 <code>color-scheme</code>，让表单控件和滚动条跟着变。</li></ul>
<h2>我们的看法</h2><p>NN/g 的研究显示用户偏好各占一部分，所以两套都要做，并记住用户的选择。预览截图同样要两套主题；UI Hub 给每个组件存浅色和深色两张截图，就是这个原因。</p>""",
 refs=[('Dark Mode — Human Interface Guidelines','Apple','https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode'),('prefers-color-scheme: Hello darkness, my old friend','web.dev (Thomas Steiner)','https://web.dev/articles/prefers-color-scheme'),('Dark Mode vs. Light Mode: Which Is Better?','Nielsen Norman Group','https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dark-mode/'),('Dark mode','Tailwind CSS','https://tailwindcss.com/docs/dark-mode')]),

dict(slug='accessibility-in-ai-generated-ui', date='2026-10-14', tags=['accessibility'],
 t=dict(en='Accessibility in AI-generated UI: the checks models skip', zh='AI 生成界面的无障碍：模型常漏的检查项', zht='AI 生成介面的無障礙：模型常漏的檢查項', ja='AI生成UIのアクセシビリティ：モデルが飛ばすチェック', ko='AI 생성 UI의 접근성: 모델이 빠뜨리는 점검', ms='Kebolehcapaian dalam UI jana AI: semakan yang dilangkau model', vi='Khả năng tiếp cận trong UI do AI tạo: những kiểm tra mô hình bỏ qua', fr="Accessibilité de l'UI générée par IA : les vérifications oubliées", es='Accesibilidad en UI generada por IA: las comprobaciones que se saltan', de='Barrierefreiheit in KI-generierter UI: die übersprungenen Checks'),
 s=dict(en='Generated UIs look fine and fail keyboards and screen readers. Start from accessible primitives, then audit against WCAG 2.2.', zh='生成的界面看着没问题，键盘和读屏却用不了。先用无障碍底层组件，再按 WCAG 2.2 走查。', zht='生成的介面看著沒問題，鍵盤和讀屏卻用不了。先用無障礙底層元件，再按 WCAG 2.2 檢查。', ja='見た目は良くてもキーボードやスクリーンリーダーで失敗。アクセシブルな基盤からWCAG 2.2で監査。', ko='보기엔 괜찮아도 키보드·스크린리더에서 실패. 접근성 기반에서 시작해 WCAG 2.2로 점검.', ms='Nampak baik tetapi gagal untuk papan kekunci dan pembaca skrin. Mula dengan primitif boleh capai, audit dengan WCAG 2.2.', vi='Trông ổn nhưng hỏng với bàn phím và trình đọc màn hình. Dùng primitive dễ tiếp cận, kiểm theo WCAG 2.2.', fr="Belles mais inutilisables au clavier. Partir de primitives accessibles, auditer selon WCAG 2.2.", es='Se ven bien pero fallan con teclado y lector. Parte de primitivas accesibles y audita con WCAG 2.2.', de='Sieht gut aus, scheitert an Tastatur und Screenreader. Mit barrierefreien Primitives starten, nach WCAG 2.2 prüfen.'),
 en="""<p>Models optimise for what a screenshot shows. Focus order, accessible names and live regions do not show up in screenshots, so they are the first things to go missing.</p>
<h2>The checks models skip most</h2><ul><li><strong>Clickable divs</strong> instead of <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>. Prompt for semantic elements explicitly.</li><li><strong>Missing focus-visible styles</strong>, often removed with <code>outline:none</code>.</li><li><strong>Icon-only buttons</strong> without <code>aria-label</code>.</li><li><strong>Contrast</strong> of grey-on-grey secondary text (WCAG 1.4.3).</li><li><strong>Target size</strong>: at least 24×24 CSS px (WCAG 2.2, 2.5.8).</li><li><strong>Dialogs</strong> without focus trap and Escape. Use the ARIA APG patterns or Radix and React Aria.</li></ul>
<h2>Our take</h2><p>Make accessibility structural, not a final pass. Generate on top of accessible primitives and add an audit skill (accessibility, web-design-guidelines) to the agent's definition of done.</p>""",
 zh="""<p>模型优化的是截图里看得见的东西。焦点顺序、可访问名称、实时播报区域在截图里都看不见，所以最先被漏掉。</p>
<h2>模型最常漏的检查项</h2><ul><li>用<strong>可点击的 div</strong> 代替 <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>，要在提示里明确要求语义元素。</li><li><strong>缺少 focus-visible 样式</strong>，常被 <code>outline:none</code> 干掉。</li><li><strong>纯图标按钮</strong>没有 <code>aria-label</code>。</li><li>灰底灰字的次要文本<strong>对比度</strong>不够（WCAG 1.4.3）。</li><li><strong>点击区域</strong>至少 24×24 CSS 像素（WCAG 2.2，2.5.8）。</li><li><strong>弹窗</strong>没有焦点锁定和 Esc 关闭，用 ARIA APG 模式或 Radix、React Aria。</li></ul>
<h2>我们的看法</h2><p>让无障碍成为结构的一部分，而不是最后补一遍。在无障碍底层组件上生成，再把走查 skill（accessibility、web-design-guidelines）写进 Agent 的完成标准。</p>""",
 refs=[('Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2','W3C','https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/'),('ARIA Authoring Practices Guide','W3C WAI','https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/'),('Radix Primitives introduction','Radix','https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/overview/introduction'),('Web Interface Guidelines','Vercel','https://vercel.com/design/guidelines')]),
]
